{
  "schema_version": "1.0",
  "encounter_id": "20323",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0001",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 0.93,
      "end_seconds": 4.36,
      "duration_seconds": 3.43,
      "text": "Good evening, doctor, thanks for seeing me."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 8.43,
      "end_seconds": 12.21,
      "duration_seconds": 3.78,
      "text": "That's fine, sit down. Tell me why you came."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "FAMILY_MEMBER",
      "start_seconds": 14.11,
      "end_seconds": 19.82,
      "duration_seconds": 5.71,
      "text": "Hello, you know, doctor, I came in with them, if that's okay."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 20.84,
      "end_seconds": 24.6,
      "duration_seconds": 3.76,
      "text": "That's fine, sit down. We'll go through it together."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 26.68,
      "end_seconds": 38.04,
      "duration_seconds": 11.36,
      "text": "Honestly, it's spots on my face, and my family pushed me to come. I didn't want to make a fuss, you know."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 38.96,
      "end_seconds": 40.32,
      "duration_seconds": 1.36,
      "text": "Since when exactly?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 41.49,
      "end_seconds": 44.44,
      "duration_seconds": 2.95,
      "text": "About... well, about a month."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 46.52,
      "end_seconds": 54.31,
      "duration_seconds": 7.79,
      "text": "Can you describe it a bit more for me? How strong it is, what the pattern is, what helps."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 56.27,
      "end_seconds": 83.28,
      "duration_seconds": 27.01,
      "text": "I notice it more with stress and greasy skin. It feels severe to me. Only face wash, and it's not much. My family kept telling me to get it checked. I've also had spots on my back, for six months. Yeah, with spots on my back, mostly severe."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 84.0,
      "end_seconds": 88.37,
      "duration_seconds": 4.37,
      "text": "Has there been marks left after the spots too?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 90.25,
      "end_seconds": 100.36,
      "duration_seconds": 10.11,
      "text": "Mm, uh, yes. As for marks left after the spots, mostly severe. I've been feeling low about my skin too."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 101.3,
      "end_seconds": 104.46,
      "duration_seconds": 3.16,
      "text": "Is it a lot or only a little?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 109.17,
      "end_seconds": 110.12,
      "duration_seconds": 0.95,
      "text": "Mostly mild."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 111.68,
      "end_seconds": 115.39,
      "duration_seconds": 3.71,
      "text": "Any excess hair growth or irregular periods at all?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 117.3,
      "end_seconds": 120.29,
      "duration_seconds": 2.99,
      "text": "Actually, no, nothing to report there."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 120.54,
      "end_seconds": 123.09,
      "duration_seconds": 2.55,
      "text": "Right, right. What about headaches?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 124.16,
      "end_seconds": 125.7,
      "duration_seconds": 1.54,
      "text": "Nope, no headaches."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "FAMILY_MEMBER",
      "start_seconds": 126.95,
      "end_seconds": 131.95,
      "duration_seconds": 5.0,
      "text": "Actually, doctor, I did notice headaches. He doesn't always say."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 134.38,
      "end_seconds": 141.29,
      "duration_seconds": 6.91,
      "text": "No, I don't think I did. Maybe a little, I'm not sure."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 142.12,
      "end_seconds": 151.99,
      "duration_seconds": 9.87,
      "text": "Alright, I'll note both what you've said and what you've noticed. Let me check a few things. Any joint pain, fever or being pregnant?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 152.7,
      "end_seconds": 158.61,
      "duration_seconds": 5.91,
      "text": "I haven't had joint pain, fever or being pregnant, no."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 159.84,
      "end_seconds": 162.41,
      "duration_seconds": 2.57,
      "text": "Is your urine normal, no changes?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 163.98,
      "end_seconds": 167.73,
      "duration_seconds": 3.75,
      "text": "That's normal as far as I know."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 168.54,
      "end_seconds": 173.09,
      "duration_seconds": 4.55,
      "text": "Are you allergic to anything? Any allergies to medicines or foods?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 174.45,
      "end_seconds": 185.35,
      "duration_seconds": 10.9,
      "text": "Plasters. I come out in... well, a red itchy rash. Kiwi. I come out in... well, an itchy mouth."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 186.57,
      "end_seconds": 189.72,
      "duration_seconds": 3.15,
      "text": "Are there any illnesses in your family?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 190.64,
      "end_seconds": 192.63,
      "duration_seconds": 1.99,
      "text": "My brother has epilepsy."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 210.21,
      "end_seconds": 212.6,
      "duration_seconds": 2.39,
      "text": "What's on your current medicine list?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 214.41,
      "end_seconds": 217.47,
      "duration_seconds": 3.06,
      "text": "Escitalopram, 10 milligrams, once a day."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "FAMILY_MEMBER",
      "start_seconds": 222.13,
      "end_seconds": 231.19,
      "duration_seconds": 9.06,
      "text": "Doctor, I think the last prescription for the escitalopram was 20 milligrams. We changed it at the last visit."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 232.47,
      "end_seconds": 236.75,
      "duration_seconds": 4.28,
      "text": "I see. Is the most recent prescription on you?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 241.81,
      "end_seconds": 252.07,
      "duration_seconds": 10.26,
      "text": "I don't think I have it with me. Hmm, I had furosemide at one point, but I'm off it now."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 266.43,
      "end_seconds": 269.9,
      "duration_seconds": 3.47,
      "text": "Alright, a few questions about your lifestyle now."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 271.19,
      "end_seconds": 282.35,
      "duration_seconds": 11.16,
      "text": "My partner and our baby. I'm a plumber, lots of bending and kneeling. I do a yoga class on Thursdays."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 297.6,
      "end_seconds": 300.85,
      "duration_seconds": 3.25,
      "text": "Any past operations I should know about?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 302.38,
      "end_seconds": 310.72,
      "duration_seconds": 8.34,
      "text": "Sorry, what was I saying, I had my appendix taken out when I was in my twenties."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 311.88,
      "end_seconds": 314.4,
      "duration_seconds": 2.52,
      "text": "Do you have any chronic illnesses?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 316.25,
      "end_seconds": 320.55,
      "duration_seconds": 4.3,
      "text": "I've had anxiety, yes. I've got heart failure."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 322.56,
      "end_seconds": 329.16,
      "duration_seconds": 6.6,
      "text": "Alright, heart failure, that matches what I have here. Okay, I'll do your observations first."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 339.19,
      "end_seconds": 342.35,
      "duration_seconds": 3.16,
      "text": "Right, keep your arm relaxed for me..."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0041",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 354.11,
      "end_seconds": 367.4,
      "duration_seconds": 13.29,
      "text": "Okay: pulse is 86 beats a minute, respiratory rate 18. And temp 36.6 degrees, weight 54 kilos, height 162 centimetres, blood pressure 127 over 81, BMI works out to 20.6."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0042",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 369.05,
      "end_seconds": 373.18,
      "duration_seconds": 4.13,
      "text": "Alright, over here please and I'll take a look."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0043",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 374.12,
      "end_seconds": 377.04,
      "duration_seconds": 2.92,
      "text": "Take a deep breath for me."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0044",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 387.56,
      "end_seconds": 394.57,
      "duration_seconds": 7.01,
      "text": "There are red inflamed lumps and blackheads over both cheeks and the forehead, and a few scars."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0045",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 398.89,
      "end_seconds": 420.46,
      "duration_seconds": 21.57,
      "text": "Good, you can sit up again. Taking everything into account, I'd lean towards moderate inflammatory acne. It could also be rosacea, so we'll keep that open. Just to be sure I understood. You've had spots on your face for about a month, severe, and no fever or being pregnant."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0046",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 422.52,
      "end_seconds": 424.26,
      "duration_seconds": 1.74,
      "text": "Yes, that's right."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0047",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 426.32,
      "end_seconds": 434.39,
      "duration_seconds": 8.07,
      "text": "And please bring the latest prescription or the medicine boxes to the next visit, so we can settle the dose."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0048",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 435.96,
      "end_seconds": 437.65,
      "duration_seconds": 1.69,
      "text": "Yes, will do."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0049",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 439.31,
      "end_seconds": 446.8,
      "duration_seconds": 7.49,
      "text": "There's nothing new for me to start or arrange today. Have I covered everything you wanted?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0050",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 448.57,
      "end_seconds": 451.76,
      "duration_seconds": 3.19,
      "text": "Good, thanks, I'll see you then."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0051",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 452.29,
      "end_seconds": 453.67,
      "duration_seconds": 1.38,
      "text": "All the best."
    }
  ]
}